---
description: Coding rules for the project.
alwaysApply: true
---


# Do not support darkmode.

- Use light mode only.
- Use light colors only.
- Use light themes only.
- Use light components only.
- Use light styles only.
- Use light utilities only.

Do not add dark: prefixes to any tailwind classes.

# Always write code in english.

Always write code in english no matter what language the user is using.